  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Ethical and Responsible Recruitment of Migrant Workers in VF Corporation&#x2019;s Global Supply Chains (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to advance ethical recruitment of migrant workers in VF corporation&apos;s global supply chains through providing IOM&apos;s technical expertise, especially to aupport the implementation and review of VF Responsible Recruitment Roadmap 2026; and provide strategic advisory and support to the implementation of the VF&apos;s Responsible Recruitment Roadmap and policies and to the implementation of the &quot;Your Voice Matters&quot; initiative. Based on the needs identified among the VF&apos;s internal and external stakeholders, the provision of technical expertise may encompass review of the company&apos;s data in relation to the achieved results or identified vulnerabilities of migrant workers in their supply chains, and review and feedback of existing ethical recruitment policies, processes and procedures at the brand or supplier level. If additional budget is available, technical expertise may also include capacity building to selected stakeholders within the VF supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
